{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20269u2407V9eC1795682130.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>現年 71 歲的資深綠葉王李鴻杰，入行多年拍攝過無數膾炙人口的經典劇集。雖然他憑藉《天龍八部》中「段延慶」一角，經典惡人形象深入民心，但現實生活中的他其實是不折不扣的「愛妻號」！日前李鴻杰在社交平台罕有高調放閃，慶祝與太太結婚 49 周年，夫妻甜蜜互動溫馨滿瀉！</p><p><p><img alt=\"2d963315-d3d3-4436-8b09-06b858f8c13d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026C25AIHnrTB1795682129.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>從相片可見，李鴻杰與太太手捧印有「Happy 49th Anniversary」字樣的精緻蛋糕展露燦爛笑容，精神奕奕；夫婦倆更在鏡頭前大方嘴對嘴「錫錫」，畫面甜到漏，閃盲一眾網民！</p><p><p><img alt=\"4888305a-177f-4e20-a735-d07fd5752f3b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ZR2vtQQQEK1795682131.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c043cb57-55b3-4a79-962c-6e78b0def995.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026HI04T7F5741795682131.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>李鴻杰亦感性向太太深情表白：「不經意在我們的婚姻路上走過 49 個年頭，感恩有你一直陪伴。」與太太攜手走過近半世紀依然恩愛如昔，這番真摯留言感動大批網民，大家紛紛湧入留言區送上祝福，大讚二人是圈中恩愛夫妻典範，更預祝他們明年順利邁向 50 周年「金婚」！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.775508+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:14.699649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:16.642226+00:00","content_hash":"7c28eac29d5b58078b80d4c91ab57cd3aa346f04db56b95d2f136f4957f5f30c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.775508+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}